+      "title": "What you already know",
+      "content": "You know the formal cause connectors *debido a* (“because of”) and *a raíz de* (“as a result of”) from B1 Unit 6. They link a cause to what followed, and they are common in history writing. Here they follow the chain that led Latin America into debt."
     },
     {
       "type": "examples",
