+          "spanish": "Se recortó el gasto público en muchos países.",
+          "english": "Public spending was cut in many countries."
         },
         {
-          "spanish": "Estas condiciones incluían, a cambio del financiamiento, recortes significativos en el gasto público.",
-          "english": "These conditions included, in exchange for the financing, significant cuts to public spending."
+          "spanish": "Se subieron los impuestos.",
+          "english": "Taxes were raised."
         },
         {
-          "spanish": "Los defensores argumentaban que valía la pena aceptar sacrificios a cambio de recuperar la estabilidad macroeconómica.",
-          "english": "Supporters argued it was worth accepting sacrifices in exchange for restoring macroeconomic stability."
+          "spanish": "Se pedía a los gobiernos exportar más.",
+          "english": "Governments were asked to export more."
         },
         {
-          "spanish": "Muchos críticos consideraban que el precio pagado, a cambio de estos préstamos, era demasiado alto en términos de soberanía.",
-          "english": "Many critics considered that the price paid, in exchange for these loans, was too high in terms of sovereignty."
+          "spanish": "En esos años se trabajaba más y se ganaba menos.",
+          "english": "In those years people worked more and earned less."
         }
       ]
     },
     {
       "type": "tip",
-      "content": "*A cambio de que* + subjunctive works when a full clause follows (*a cambio de que aceptaran*); *a cambio de* + noun works when only a noun phrase follows (*a cambio del financiamiento*) -- don't mix the two structures."
+      "content": "Singular noun, singular verb (*se recortó el gasto*); plural noun, plural verb (*se subieron los impuestos*); no noun, singular verb (*se trabajaba más*). Use *se* when the agent is unknown or not important; if you want to name the agent, use an active sentence: *el FMI pidió recortes*."
     }
   ]
 }
diff --git a/content/es-latam/grammar/b1/b1-crisisdeuda-04-en-detrimento-de-gr.json b/content/es-latam/grammar/b1/b1-crisisdeuda-04-en-detrimento-de-gr.json
