   "sections": [
     {
       "type": "text",
-      "content": "*En pos de* (in pursuit of) names the goal that a policy, reform, or effort is chasing -- similar to *con el fin de* but noun-focused rather than verb-focused, and common in economic and political writing. It's followed by a noun phrase. These sentences are taken directly from the previous reading."
